# VARA — example environment variables
#
# You normally do NOT need this file: run `vara setup` and paste your key —
# it is stored encrypted in VARA's vault (never in a file in this repo).
#
# Environment variables are only a fallback when a vault entry is missing
# (handy in CI). Each provider has a conventional name:
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=
# XAI_API_KEY=
# TOGETHER_API_KEY=
#
# VARA_HOME changes where sessions, config and the vault live (default: ~/.vara).
# VARA_HOME=
#
# NEVER commit a real `.env` file. This example contains no valid keys.
